{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《璀璨之城》昨晚（3日）播出連場重頭戲，其中張智霖、高海寧、張曦雯及吳卓羲同場對峙的一幕，以一鏡到底拍攝。</p><p>4人須兼顧大量對白、情緒轉折及精密走位，與攝影團隊反覆排練逾3小時，才完成這場長達數分鐘的戲分。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:05:37.743393+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:08:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:18:27.435887+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:58:27.181382+00:00","content_hash":"b507e6a73421948a94a38b13121d2b59b1752e4bcaa097849dbaf6f72eb2e211","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}